~ pickup_ornot
odddouglas: Pick up the ember?

- (Pick it up)
	if not Game.CAN_PICKUP:
		set Game.CAN_PICKUP = true
	=> END
- (Leave it)
	=> END

~ npc_intro
keeper: You finally woke up.
keeper: This ruin is going dark. The ember nearby is our only light.

- (Where is the ember?)
	keeper: It is close. Take it before the dark finds you.
	=> END
- (I will find it.)
	keeper: Bring it back when you know what it is hiding.
	=> END

~ npc_return
keeper: You found the ember.
keeper: Hold it close. It remembers a path the ruin forgot.
- (What path?)
	keeper: The sealed gate beyond this room is waiting for its light.
- (I am ready.)
	keeper: Then follow the warm stones.